Scope

The MIT License above applies to the original KarioBSD source code:
the kernel (kernel/), the C library (libc/), the userland (user/), the
build system (Makefile, tools/, boot/kernel.ld, boot/limine.conf), and
the shared headers (shared/include/).

This repository also contains third-party software under different
licenses. Those components are NOT covered by the MIT License above and
retain their own terms. See third_party.md for the full inventory.

In particular, the userland binaries /bin/as and /bin/ld are built from
TinyCC (LGPL 2.1 or later) and therefore carry LGPL obligations even
though they are distributed as part of a MIT-licensed operating system.
The corresponding source and the object files needed to relink them with
a modified TinyCC or libkario are provided by the KarioBSD build system.
